$0.36 swap) against the $8.00 cap. Both legs delivered exactly their quoted output, so there was no shortfall against the 50 bps slippage cap. The harness doesn't report realized cost, so $1.76 is the quote, not a measured figure.\n\nGas: eth1 paid 0.0003 ETH for the bridge tx. It went from 0.15 ETH to 0.0497 ETH after the 0.1 ETH bridged. base1 kept 0.00002 ETH (20000000000000 wei, equal to `gas_per_tx`) after paying for the swap, so it can send one more transaction. That reserve is the only ETH left on Base.\n\nNo legs are in transit.","outcome":{"kind":"target_reached"},"balances":{"base1":{"USDC":"299079999","ETH":"20000000000000"},"eth1":{"ETH":"49700000000000000"}},"in_transit_legs":[]},"id":"toolu_01RjLpDbyoioxsdxz6txZmew"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":41,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"reported\":true}","toolCallId":"toolu_01RjLpDbyoioxsdxz6txZmew","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":42,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your 0.1 ETH from the Ethereum wallet (`eth1`) is now 299.079999 USDC on the Base wallet (`base1`).\n\n- **Route:** I bridged the ETH to Base (tx_7), then swapped it to USDC on Base (tx_8). Both legs confirmed and delivered exactly their quoted amounts.\n- **Cost:** The quoted total was $1.76, against your $8.00 cap. The harness doesn't report realized cost, so that figure is the quote.\n- **Gas reserve:** `base1` keeps 0.00002 ETH (20000000000000 wei), enough for one more transaction. That is the only ETH left on Base.\n- **Final balances:** `base1` has 299079999 USDC and 20000000000000 wei ETH. `eth1` has 49700000000000000 wei ETH, which is 0.0497 ETH.\n- **In transit:** Nothing is still in transit."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"ca86e54291